   "updated_at": "Updated At"
   }
   ```
   Parameters:
      - type: string (required)
        Description: Logical type (payment, payout, refund, invoice, donation, subscription, api_app)
      - direction: string (required)
        Description: Money flow relative to user (sent, received, internal)
      - amount: number (required)
        Description: Transaction amount in the given currency
      - currency_code: string (required)
        Description: Currency code of the transaction
      - status: string (required)
        Description: Transaction status (created, pending, completed, refunded, canceled)
      - category: string (optional)
        Description: Category of the transaction
      - funding_source_type: string (optional)
        Description: Type of funding source (balance, card, bank)
      - funding_source_id: integer (optional)
        Description: ID of payment_methods record used as funding source
      - counterparty_contact_id: integer (optional)
        Description: Contact ID when paying or receiving from a saved contact
      - counterparty_email: string (optional)
        Description: Email of counterparty when no contact_id is used
      - merchant_name: string (optional)
        Description: Merchant name when relevant
      - invoice_id: integer (optional)
        Description: Linked invoice ID when paying an invoice
      - payout_batch_id: integer (optional)
        Description: Linked payout_batches ID when this transaction is part of a payout
      - subscription_agreement_id: integer (optional)
        Description: Linked subscription_agreements ID for recurring payments
      - qr_code_link_id: integer (optional)
        Description: Linked qr_code_payment_links ID when paid via QR link
      - donation_link_id: integer (optional)
        Description: Linked donation_links ID when paid via donation link
      - api_app_id: integer (optional)
        Description: Linked api_apps ID if this transaction was initiated via an app
      - parent_transaction_id: integer (optional)
        Description: Parent transaction ID for refunds or reversals
      - note: string (optional)
        Description: User-supplied note or memo for this transaction

